IdeaGitTool

This extension re-creates the git UI of Rebased (https://github.com/detachhead/rebased),
which is based on the IntelliJ Platform (https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community).

The icons in media/icons are copied from those projects (the extension logo, media/ideagittool.*, is original):
  Copyright 2000-2026 JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
UI texts follow GitBundle.properties / VcsBundle.properties of the IntelliJ Platform (Apache 2.0).

The standalone desktop merge editor reuses IdeaGitTool's merge models, editor
controller, theme and gutter icons. The copied icons are in src/merge/icons;
their JetBrains attribution and Apache 2.0 notice above also apply to them.
The standalone workbench also reuses the icons in src/ui/icons under the same
JetBrains attribution and Apache 2.0 notice.
